(`complete single-trust runtime and storage cutover`), `b8eeefca`, `c96c1f7f`, and `a827449c`.
`c924a92e` deletes the obsolete EVM `authority-integration` feature bridge. Every new commit
leaves one coherent current design; no compatibility path or parallel production implementation
was added.

